    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_message">BLE Advertise is an educational and security-testing tool. It reproduces the advertising signatures of Google Fast Pair, Apple Continuity, Samsung Easy Setup and Microsoft Swift Pair so that nearby phones show the matching pairing popup.\n\nA BLE advertisement is one-way: a phone that receives it never exposes its microphone, camera, storage or data to the advertiser. Use it only on devices you own or control, and never to harass others.</string>
